body:
For my code actions PR, I just found that the following gives a good position for the popup, just below where the caret currently is:
```cpp
Vector2 pos = get_global_position() + get_caret_draw_pos();
pos.y += get_line_height() * 1.5;
code_action_popup->popup(Rect2i(pos, Size2i()));
```
<img width="423" height="145" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d25a7a17-e375-4dc3-836c-78003441a371" />

I'm a little iffy on that `1.5` magic number but it seems to scale the raw line height up such that the popup lands where it needs to be 😅

